  "lineage": "Late-1980s-and-1990s Palm Desert California scene that birthed stoner rock through generator-party performances in the high desert outside Palm Springs and Joshua Tree. The \"generator parties\" allowed local bands (Kyuss, Yawning Man, Across the River, Fatso Jetson) to perform with the band powered by gasoline generators in remote desert locations free of police interference. The 1988-1992 generator-party period mythologized the geographic-cultural specificity of the desert-rock scene.",
